craftableCreatures.guide.page9.mainText.2=Smelting Recipes
craftableCreatures.guide.page9.mainText.3=Extracting Recipes
craftableCreatures.guide.page9.mainText.4=Combining Recipes
craftableCreatures.guide.page10.chapter=Chapter 8, Transmutator
craftableCreatures.guide.page10.mainText.1=Transmutator lets you morph into other mob, which soul you have. It has its own inventory that you can open by using transmutator. Inventory has 9 slots for storage and 1 for work. You should put mob's soul in it and then press button 'morph'. Player will morph into mob and get its abilities. To demorph into player use usual soul.
craftableCreatures.guide.page10.mainText.2=You must install Morph mod by iChun in order to make transmutator work.